  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "k0004",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "1682 is only a few weeks away, and we’ve been busy securing ",
          "_key": "k0005"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0000"
          ],
          "text": "speakers and moderators",
          "_key": "k0006"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for the event. There’s one part of our business of innovation conference you may not know about: our Venture Awards.",
          "_key": "k0007"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0000",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://1682conf.com/#speakers"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0008",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "To honor the spirit of innovation during 1682, we created the Venture Awards to give Philadelphia startups a chance to participate in the day. Three startups will pitch their businesses to our audience of C-suite and senior organizational leaders in business, technology, and design. After some quick Q&A and feedback from the audience, they’ll vote on the business concept they like the most, and the winning startups will receive a $5,000 prize!",
          "_key": "k0009"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0010",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Are you interested in pitching your company? You only need to meet three simple criteria:",
          "_key": "k0011"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0012",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Must not have received more than $500,000 in funding",
          "_key": "k0013"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0014",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Must be founded and based in Philadelphia",
          "_key": "k0015"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0016",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Must currently develop or leverage new and emerging technology in innovative ways",
          "_key": "k0017"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal",
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0018",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Does that sound like your startup? ",
          "_key": "k0019"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0001"
          ],
          "text": "Then apply now",
          "_key": "k0020"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "! The deadline to submit is August 30th, and chosen startups will be notified by September 13th.",
          "_key": "k0021"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "k0001",
          "_type": "link",
          "href": "https://bit.ly/33LpEib"
        }
      ],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0022",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This is a can’t miss opportunity for startups in the city. If you know a startup that would be a good fit for the day, be sure to send them our ",
          "_key": "k0023"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0002"
          ],
          "text": "1682 Venture Awards one-sheeter ",
          "_key": "k0024"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "and ",
          "_key": "k0025"
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "k0003"
          ],
          "text": "application link!",
          "_key": "k0026"
        }
